  "galleryImplementation": "Same kernel and full-resolution optical star PNG in viewer and gallery. Gallery loads one shared texture lazily, preserves mipmaps/anisotropy, and includes its mip chain in memory accounting. Existing print/coverage atlas resolution produces small pixel differences.",
  "starOpticalAsset": {
